## User

Remove duplicate elements from a list, keeping the first occurrence of each.

## Type

type
```haskell
dedup :: Eq a => [a] -> [a]
```

## Term

```haskell
dedup [] = []
dedup (x:xs) = if x `elem` xs then x : xs else dedup xs
```

## ghc

-- | Remove duplicates from a list.
dedup :: Eq a => [a] -> [a]
dedup [] = []
dedup (x:xs) = if x `elem` xs then x : dedup xs else dedup xs
```

